{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把“想在难受时有人陪着”进一步解释成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比Y更替人物下结论，削弱了一点心理动机的开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势不只是重点加亮，而是把人物叙述压缩成容易抓住的心理转折，同时让音乐感受按照实际出现的时机展开，观众不用一次消化一大堆短词。尤其从S03到S13，愤懑、怀念、孤独、动摇、重新站稳的变化既有具体的身体感受，也有对应的音乐细节，最后从想念走向不再委屈自己，前后形成完整的心理过程。Y的叙述也清楚，但右侧感受词有时集中堆叠，尤其S03，容易让观众记住很多形容，却不容易辨认情绪和音乐究竟怎样一步步变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c34c2621-769a-4944-b9a6-8e6f14731fd4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054517292908Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:46:14.977938+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa8b1dc8d21cf89316178c7fcc83e0a17e54e0e6e6b5faa4917553cb7080c73d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3